correctness.suggestedFix:
Move the `last` update before the inner write loop so the current position is included:
    for (int i = len; i >= 1; i--)
    {
        last[text[i - 1]] = i;
        for (int c = 0; c < sigma; c++)
            next[(i - 1) * sigma + c] = last[c];
    }
Equivalently, use the standard forward form: for i = len-1 downto 0, copy row i+1 into row i, then set next[i*sigma + text[i]] = i + 1.
